WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.160 --> 01:55.688
=Episode 26=

22
01:59.590 --> 02:00.469
Why did you suddenly

23
02:00.710 --> 02:01.469
bring me here?

24
02:02.469 --> 02:03.829
You've been stressed out lately.

25
02:04.070 --> 02:05.829
A walk will do you good.

26
02:06.629 --> 02:08.110
It's my job to ensure

27
02:08.229 --> 02:09.229
you get some proper rest.

28
02:09.509 --> 02:10.430
Don't burn out.

29
02:13.310 --> 02:14.990
You act like a different person lately.

30
02:16.110 --> 02:16.669
Mr. Jiao,

31
02:17.229 --> 02:18.629
do you treat all your clients

32
02:18.949 --> 02:19.590
like this?

33
02:20.509 --> 02:21.270
Not really.

34
02:21.590 --> 02:22.390
Other clients

35
02:22.430 --> 02:23.669
don't pay me that much.

36
02:26.710 --> 02:27.349
Let me help you.

37
02:30.270 --> 02:30.710
Come on.

38
02:38.789 --> 02:39.270
Careful.

39
02:44.430 --> 02:44.990
My shoes!

40
02:44.990 --> 02:46.189
Let go. Let go.

41
02:46.390 --> 02:46.710
Let...

42
02:47.272 --> 02:50.824
♪I was never the clever one♪

43
02:51.048 --> 02:54.504
♪Just trying to live with heart♪

44
02:55.909 --> 02:57.069
Let... Let's head over first.

45
03:00.712 --> 03:05.128
♪Some embrace while some turn cold♪

46
03:07.229 --> 03:08.349
You almost choked me.

47
03:09.789 --> 03:10.550
Aren't you

48
03:10.789 --> 03:11.710
here just fine?

49
03:14.069 --> 03:14.509
What?

50
03:14.588 --> 03:15.629
Why are you staring at me?

51
03:15.629 --> 03:16.629
I feel like you've

52
03:17.629 --> 03:18.469
changed a lot today.

53
03:21.430 --> 03:21.909
Before,

54
03:21.949 --> 03:23.189
you put on a tough front,

55
03:23.789 --> 03:24.550
but I could see

56
03:24.830 --> 03:26.030
you were fragile inside.

57
03:26.550 --> 03:27.189
But today,

58
03:27.349 --> 03:27.870
you're bright

59
03:28.536 --> 03:29.145
and confident.

60
03:35.279 --> 03:36.134
I choke you a little,

61
03:36.390 --> 03:37.710
and you get all sentimental?

62
03:46.830 --> 03:47.669
The words

63
03:48.870 --> 03:50.069
just came out.

64
03:57.110 --> 03:57.469
Done.

65
03:58.629 --> 03:59.189
All clean.

66
04:02.110 --> 04:02.629
What?

67
04:03.430 --> 04:04.270
Are you OCD too?

68
04:07.331 --> 04:08.150
I'm

69
04:08.913 --> 04:10.655
only obsessive about things you care about.

70
04:10.655 --> 04:15.048
♪Some embrace while some turn cold♪

71
04:15.909 --> 04:16.750
I'm worried

72
04:17.150 --> 04:18.270
Di Liren might play dirty.

73
04:19.030 --> 04:19.568
So,

74
04:19.568 --> 04:20.390
wherever you investigate,

75
04:20.390 --> 04:21.310
I'm going with you.

76
04:21.590 --> 04:22.150
Let me know

77
04:22.229 --> 04:23.229
once you find anything.

78
04:28.070 --> 04:28.510
Jiao Xu.

79
04:32.349 --> 04:32.830
Thank you.

80
04:40.190 --> 04:40.740
You're back.

81
04:46.309 --> 04:47.510
Rest up. I'll get it.

82
04:48.109 --> 04:48.710
I'm used to it.

83
05:00.109 --> 05:00.630
Hui,

84
05:03.349 --> 05:04.469
you're my wife now.

85
05:05.429 --> 05:05.950
You don't

86
05:06.349 --> 05:07.070
have to do these.

87
05:31.590 --> 05:31.989
Hui.

88
05:33.150 --> 05:33.590
Eat up.

89
05:44.950 --> 05:45.590
That's it.

90
05:46.469 --> 05:47.309
Remember when we were

91
05:47.630 --> 05:48.469
in that rental?

92
05:49.440 --> 05:50.190
You often made me

93
05:50.190 --> 05:51.030
these plain noodles

94
05:51.429 --> 05:52.030
at night.

95
05:52.630 --> 05:53.190
Back then,

96
05:53.789 --> 05:55.109
we couldn't afford an extra egg.

97
05:56.190 --> 05:56.830
But to me,

98
05:57.349 --> 05:57.909
it was better

99
05:57.989 --> 05:59.109
than any delicacy today.

100
06:04.359 --> 06:06.037
Still mad about what happened at the office

101
06:06.549 --> 06:07.229
this afternoon?

102
06:09.469 --> 06:10.909
I was thinking of the big picture.

103
06:11.630 --> 06:12.669
People out there say

104
06:12.669 --> 06:13.510
you settled

105
06:13.549 --> 06:14.549
for a maid like me.

106
06:16.590 --> 06:17.510
Do you feel that way?

107
06:19.549 --> 06:20.590
That's just idle gossip.

108
06:21.270 --> 06:22.109
Don't mind it.

109
06:23.150 --> 06:23.750
Tell me.

110
06:24.630 --> 06:26.270
If I'd never been a maid,

111
06:27.030 --> 06:27.710
would people

112
06:27.750 --> 06:28.789
not look down on me?

113
06:29.429 --> 06:30.830
If I hadn't gone to the Yu family,

114
06:31.469 --> 06:32.070
would Mr. Yu

115
06:32.150 --> 06:33.309
not be in a coma?

116
06:35.630 --> 06:36.750
If I hadn't come here,

117
06:38.390 --> 06:39.549
Haoyu wouldn't be hurt.

118
06:46.510 --> 06:47.429
Why say this now?

119
06:47.750 --> 06:48.710
If it weren't for me,

120
06:50.590 --> 06:51.669
you'd still be the perfect

121
06:51.750 --> 06:52.989
son-in-law of the Yus.

122
06:55.630 --> 06:56.950
Even for a second,

123
06:58.669 --> 06:59.510
even

124
07:00.830 --> 07:02.150
as a passing thought,

125
07:03.150 --> 07:03.909
did you ever think

126
07:05.750 --> 07:06.830
that if I died,

127
07:07.390 --> 07:08.270
everything

128
07:08.390 --> 07:09.190
would be different?

129
07:15.590 --> 07:16.270
I get it.

130
07:22.190 --> 07:22.669
Hui.

131
07:32.510 --> 07:33.630
I want to work at Jiali.

132
07:34.229 --> 07:34.669
No.

133
07:36.150 --> 07:36.789
If you hate

134
07:36.909 --> 07:37.789
all the gossip,

135
07:38.229 --> 07:39.390
why keep diving into it?

136
07:40.750 --> 07:42.270
Because I'm sick

137
07:42.789 --> 07:43.830
of living in the shadows.

138
07:44.669 --> 07:45.270
Just stay home

139
07:45.590 --> 07:46.950
and be Mrs. Di.

140
07:50.989 --> 07:51.869
I thought you'd find

141
07:51.909 --> 07:52.869
a better excuse.

142
07:53.630 --> 07:54.590
I've basically found out

143
07:54.669 --> 07:55.830
everything about Peng Cheng.

144
07:57.349 --> 07:58.229
Take a look at this.

145
08:01.229 --> 08:02.989
It starts with this garment factory.

146
08:03.510 --> 08:04.309
Check the legal rep.

147
08:04.680 --> 08:06.056
(Hongli Garment Factory, Legal Representative: Lu Hui)

148
08:06.630 --> 08:07.150
Lu Hui?

149
08:07.768 --> 08:08.569
When I saw Lu Hui

150
08:08.569 --> 08:09.989
was the legal rep of the factory,

151
08:09.989 --> 08:10.669
I wasn't sure

152
08:10.750 --> 08:11.309
if this Lu Hui

153
08:11.349 --> 08:12.510
was the one we knew.

154
08:13.390 --> 08:14.909
So I followed the lead

155
08:15.270 --> 08:16.710
and dug up old newspapers.

156
08:17.549 --> 08:19.190
The paper clearly stated

157
08:20.938 --> 08:22.538
that the owner of Hongli Garment Factory,

158
08:22.538 --> 08:23.863
Lu Zhiming, died in a car crash,

159
08:23.950 --> 08:25.309
and Peng, the party involved,

160
08:25.469 --> 08:26.830
was released for lack of evidence.

161
08:26.888 --> 08:27.510
(Breaking! Hongli Garment Factory Owner Lu Zhiming Died in Car Crash)

162
08:27.510 --> 08:28.909
I remember you told me

163
08:29.030 --> 08:30.229
that Lu Hui's dad died

164
08:30.309 --> 08:31.510
before she got married.

165
08:32.390 --> 08:33.549
So it's reasonable to deduce

166
08:33.909 --> 08:34.589
that Lu Zhiming

167
08:34.990 --> 08:35.949
is Lu Hui's dad.

168
08:37.608 --> 08:38.536
(Police found insufficient evidence to assign liability)

169
08:38.536 --> 08:39.432
(Given Peng's cooperation, the family has decided not to press charges)

170
08:40.230 --> 08:41.270
So this Peng

171
08:42.789 --> 08:43.870
is very likely Peng Cheng.

172
08:49.309 --> 08:50.350
I think we can make

173
08:50.470 --> 08:51.510
a bold guess.

174
08:54.189 --> 08:54.750
Looks like

175
08:55.750 --> 08:56.270
I need

176
08:56.309 --> 08:57.390
to see Lu Hui again.

177
09:04.350 --> 09:04.870
Morning.

178
09:12.630 --> 09:13.589
What are you doing here?

179
09:13.709 --> 09:14.829
Routine shareholder visit.

180
09:15.189 --> 09:16.069
I forgot to tell you.

181
09:16.829 --> 09:18.030
Haoyu has entrusted his shares

182
09:18.270 --> 09:18.990
to me.

183
09:19.630 --> 09:20.949
You don't know the business here.

184
09:21.309 --> 09:21.949
Why insist

185
09:22.030 --> 09:22.630
on interfering?

186
09:22.789 --> 09:24.030
I can learn.

187
09:24.789 --> 09:25.470
I was new

188
09:25.589 --> 09:26.350
to maid work too,

189
09:27.150 --> 09:28.309
but didn't I do a great job?

190
09:28.990 --> 09:29.870
That's different.

191
09:30.630 --> 09:31.589
How is it different?

192
09:32.549 --> 09:33.510
If Yu Meng could learn,

193
09:34.270 --> 09:35.270
why can't I?

194
09:38.150 --> 09:38.909
Don't mess around.

195
09:39.390 --> 09:40.470
Yu Meng is in the past.

196
09:41.069 --> 09:41.709
Whatever it is,

197
09:42.189 --> 09:43.230
let's talk at home, okay?

198
09:43.400 --> 09:46.150
(Jiali)

199
09:46.150 --> 09:46.470
Mr. Di.

200
10:02.309 --> 10:03.309
Show her around.

201
10:12.350 --> 10:12.870
Fang,

202
10:14.150 --> 10:15.789
lend me another 500,000 yuan to get by.

203
10:25.789 --> 10:27.510
I just gave you money last month.

204
10:27.870 --> 10:29.589
We've been friends for decades.

205
10:30.309 --> 10:30.789
Back when we

206
10:30.870 --> 10:31.589
scraped by,

207
10:31.589 --> 10:32.789
you weren't this stingy.

208
10:33.949 --> 10:35.390
Well, you're a big boss now.

209
10:36.429 --> 10:37.909
But I'm still broke as a joke.

210
10:38.549 --> 10:39.829
Let me share in your success.

211
10:40.350 --> 10:40.813
Peng Cheng,

212
10:41.309 --> 10:42.069
honestly,

213
10:43.069 --> 10:44.549
haven't I given you enough?

214
10:45.669 --> 10:46.870
I gave you a car repair shop,

215
10:47.709 --> 10:48.470
a restaurant,

216
10:49.737 --> 10:50.464
and pulled strings

217
10:50.464 --> 10:51.671
to get you into a big corp.

218
10:52.510 --> 10:53.789
That was all real money

219
10:53.829 --> 10:54.549
poured into you!

220
10:55.949 --> 10:56.549
But you?

221
10:57.829 --> 10:59.429
You slacked off every other day,

222
11:00.309 --> 11:01.390
completely useless.

223
11:02.390 --> 11:04.069
You didn't even look at the books.

224
11:04.709 --> 11:05.709
If you cared a bit...

225
11:05.829 --> 11:06.949
Care what?

226
11:07.189 --> 11:07.789
Keep it down!

227
11:16.709 --> 11:18.030
You think I don't know?

228
11:19.110 --> 11:20.030
Don't act like

229
11:20.069 --> 11:21.189
you're so noble.

230
11:21.549 --> 11:22.470
You helped me?

231
11:23.390 --> 11:24.270
You just wanted

232
11:24.350 --> 11:25.829
to brush off a beggar,

233
11:25.990 --> 11:26.909
keeping me far away,

234
11:26.990 --> 11:28.189
so I wouldn't ruin your plans.

235
11:32.069 --> 11:32.870
Aren't you using

236
11:32.870 --> 11:33.829
the Xiaocheng matter

237
11:33.909 --> 11:34.589
to threaten me?

238
11:35.470 --> 11:36.510
Come to snitch to Yu Meng?

239
11:41.309 --> 11:41.750
How is it?

240
11:52.589 --> 11:53.069
Don't run!

241
11:53.669 --> 11:54.110
Stop!

242
11:56.669 --> 11:57.390
Yu Meng and I

243
11:57.510 --> 11:58.189
are divorced.

244
11:58.990 --> 11:59.829
What do you want now?

245
12:01.549 --> 12:02.309
I want you

246
12:02.429 --> 12:04.069
to pay me to keep my mouth shut.

247
12:14.110 --> 12:15.030
Jiali is now

248
12:15.110 --> 12:16.709
at the center of a public outcry.

249
12:18.949 --> 12:20.669
If people find out

250
12:20.990 --> 12:22.069
your entrepreneurial story

251
12:22.110 --> 12:23.589
was built on picking the bones

252
12:23.589 --> 12:24.630
of two dead families,

253
12:25.630 --> 12:26.510
what will happen?

254
12:28.789 --> 12:29.470
Peng Cheng,

255
12:30.549 --> 12:31.589
listen carefully.

256
12:31.909 --> 12:32.470
Now, Jiali

257
12:32.549 --> 12:33.630
can't take any more hits.

258
12:33.990 --> 12:34.589
If you still

259
12:34.630 --> 12:35.709
want to leech off me,

260
12:36.309 --> 12:37.709
you'd better behave.

261
12:37.990 --> 12:38.470
Getting mad?

262
12:45.949 --> 12:47.949
Pay up, and I'll keep quiet.

263
12:48.549 --> 12:49.230
500,000 yuan

264
12:49.350 --> 12:50.949
is nothing for an entrepreneur

265
12:51.510 --> 12:52.429
like you, right?

266
13:05.390 --> 13:06.309
Give me some more time,

267
13:07.150 --> 13:07.630
okay?

268
13:17.096 --> 13:18.856
(Chairman's Office)

269
13:24.270 --> 13:24.669
Wait.

270
13:25.630 --> 13:26.069
Hui.

271
13:27.150 --> 13:27.789
Who was that?

272
13:30.870 --> 13:32.150
An old fellow asking for money.

273
13:36.150 --> 13:36.630
Not close,

274
13:37.429 --> 13:37.990
so I said no.

275
13:38.669 --> 13:39.510
When did you meet?

276
13:40.150 --> 13:41.110
At a car wash

277
13:41.110 --> 13:41.688
the other day.

278
13:41.949 --> 13:42.630
What's his name?

279
13:43.470 --> 13:44.429
I didn't catch it.

280
13:45.309 --> 13:46.069
Why do you ask?

281
13:46.709 --> 13:47.189
Nothing.

282
13:48.510 --> 13:49.510
He just looks familiar.

283
14:15.270 --> 14:15.669
Get in.

284
14:16.145 --> 14:16.989
I'll take you to him.

285
14:38.230 --> 14:38.789
Mr. Peng.

286
14:39.030 --> 14:39.549
Coming.

287
14:48.350 --> 14:48.870
What's up?

288
14:51.030 --> 14:51.909
Don't you know me?

289
14:55.429 --> 14:55.829
Miss,

290
14:56.949 --> 14:58.030
you don't ring a bell.

291
14:59.189 --> 15:00.189
If not here for a repair,

292
15:00.470 --> 15:01.549
don't get in my way.

293
15:10.270 --> 15:10.829
Sir.

294
15:11.870 --> 15:13.470
There's an issue with my wheel.

295
15:13.829 --> 15:14.589
Mind taking a look?

296
15:15.189 --> 15:16.309
Sure. Come on.

297
15:23.750 --> 15:25.150
Talk about bad luck.

298
15:27.669 --> 15:28.309
Interesting.

299
15:29.350 --> 15:30.350
You actually teamed up?

300
15:30.870 --> 15:31.309
Exactly.

301
15:31.669 --> 15:32.150
Speak up.

302
15:32.838 --> 15:33.618
What do you want?

303
15:34.067 --> 15:35.425
How long have you known Di Liren?

304
15:36.789 --> 15:37.829
You should ask him that.

305
15:37.861 --> 15:38.877
What's your relationship?

306
15:39.261 --> 15:39.977
What did he say?

307
15:41.390 --> 15:42.270
He said not close.

308
15:42.750 --> 15:43.510
Not close?

309
15:46.510 --> 15:47.470
Then go ask Mr. Di

310
15:48.230 --> 15:49.510
whether we are close or not.

311
15:50.909 --> 15:51.870
You go ask him too.

312
16:06.829 --> 16:08.030
Why were you following me?

313
16:10.510 --> 16:11.709
I wasn't following you.

314
16:12.429 --> 16:13.150
It was Peng Cheng.

315
16:17.030 --> 16:18.350
Did you remarry Di Liren

316
16:19.390 --> 16:20.189
because of him?

317
16:23.870 --> 16:25.069
So Peng Cheng is connected

318
16:25.829 --> 16:26.870
to your dad's death?

319
16:33.990 --> 16:34.350
Okay.

320
16:35.510 --> 16:36.909
We have the same goal now.

321
16:39.510 --> 16:40.270
Let's take down

322
16:40.630 --> 16:41.549
Di Liren together.

323
16:45.224 --> 16:47.944
(Keep Quiet)

324
17:32.589 --> 17:33.564
I'll get the doctor now.

325
17:43.549 --> 17:44.149
I told you

326
17:44.149 --> 17:45.246
he doesn't want to see you.

327
17:45.750 --> 17:46.510
You broke in?

328
17:47.109 --> 17:47.629
No.

329
17:48.430 --> 17:49.230
I won't force him.

330
17:49.470 --> 17:49.950
Don't worry.

331
17:50.869 --> 17:51.470
Go back.

332
17:52.750 --> 17:53.629
He still needs time.

333
17:56.389 --> 17:57.230
Step by step.

334
17:58.549 --> 17:59.750
I'll make him forgive me.

335
18:11.750 --> 18:12.149
Mom.

336
18:12.910 --> 18:13.230
Mom?

337
18:15.629 --> 18:16.230
What's wrong?

338
18:17.629 --> 18:18.190
It's nothing.

339
18:19.389 --> 18:20.589
You've been zoning out lately.

340
18:21.869 --> 18:22.549
Is it

341
18:23.090 --> 18:23.699
because of him?

342
18:24.309 --> 18:25.430
Sometimes, I wonder

343
18:26.629 --> 18:27.789
if my decision to remarry

344
18:28.510 --> 18:29.510
was really the right one.

345
18:30.230 --> 18:31.389
His only goal right now

346
18:31.789 --> 18:33.270
is to get your forgiveness.

347
18:33.549 --> 18:34.829
He won't give up easily.

348
18:36.430 --> 18:37.069
I was wondering

349
18:37.069 --> 18:38.589
if I should just leave all this behind

350
18:39.470 --> 18:40.589
and take you away.

351
18:42.030 --> 18:43.190
We can go far away from here

352
18:43.750 --> 18:44.629
and start over.

353
18:45.064 --> 18:46.057
I don't want to see him,

354
18:47.710 --> 18:49.030
but with my condition,

355
18:50.044 --> 18:50.984
I can't go anywhere.

356
18:51.389 --> 18:51.910
Maybe

357
18:52.510 --> 18:53.829
fate kept you here

358
18:54.190 --> 18:55.309
to resolve this obsession.

359
18:57.670 --> 18:59.109
Can you tell me what it really is?

360
19:00.149 --> 19:01.230
Just some old stuff.

361
19:02.829 --> 19:04.109
I haven't sorted it out myself.

362
19:06.030 --> 19:06.710
What if...

363
19:07.910 --> 19:08.750
I mean, what if

364
19:09.349 --> 19:10.470
he really goes to prison?

365
19:11.349 --> 19:12.092
How do you feel?

366
19:12.309 --> 19:13.109
He's my dad.

367
19:15.309 --> 19:16.750
He was good to me before.

368
19:17.230 --> 19:18.309
But he's not a good person.

369
19:21.389 --> 19:21.670
Mom,

370
19:22.030 --> 19:23.430
we've done all we could.

371
19:24.069 --> 19:25.030
We protected him before.

372
19:25.629 --> 19:26.990
Anything he does,

373
19:27.629 --> 19:28.710
any punishment he takes,

374
19:30.149 --> 19:31.710
it's his own choice.

375
19:37.160 --> 19:38.710
(Night Talk on Life)

376
19:38.710 --> 19:39.349
What do those

377
19:39.430 --> 19:40.349
at the club do?

378
19:41.789 --> 19:42.910
They provide legal aid.

379
19:43.309 --> 19:44.869
Basically, for a few dozen yuan,

380
19:45.190 --> 19:46.549
people get a legal consultation.

381
19:47.069 --> 19:48.270
Occasional legal outreach too.

382
19:48.589 --> 19:49.829
Basically non-profit work.

383
19:50.389 --> 19:51.710
With Yu Meng's influence,

384
19:52.230 --> 19:53.030
this model

385
19:53.030 --> 19:54.510
is quite appealing to investors.

386
19:56.349 --> 19:57.109
So high on her,

387
19:57.230 --> 19:58.430
why didn't you go with her?

388
19:58.829 --> 19:59.629
I told you to handle

389
19:59.750 --> 20:00.589
the investors,

390
20:01.270 --> 20:02.510
not turn yourself into her fan!

391
20:02.950 --> 20:03.389
I'm sorry.

392
20:04.430 --> 20:05.270
Useless trash.

393
20:05.309 --> 20:06.030
Get out!

394
20:10.760 --> 20:17.608
(Wu Ta)

395
20:33.032 --> 20:33.832
(Liu Zi)

396
20:40.149 --> 20:41.109
How is Chestnut doing?

397
20:41.589 --> 20:42.309
Why are you here?

398
20:42.670 --> 20:43.349
Yu Meng told me.

399
20:43.869 --> 20:45.030
Still getting checked inside.

400
20:45.149 --> 20:45.910
I hope she's okay.

401
20:48.190 --> 20:48.670
Yu Meng said

402
20:49.039 --> 20:49.710
luckily Chestnut

403
20:49.789 --> 20:50.750
only slipped

404
20:50.750 --> 20:51.486
on the last step.

405
20:51.829 --> 20:52.608
It wasn't high.

406
20:52.608 --> 20:53.485
She'll be fine.

407
21:00.910 --> 21:01.910
Who's the guardian?

408
21:02.230 --> 21:02.869
Does she have

409
21:02.910 --> 21:03.670
any drug allergies?

410
21:03.869 --> 21:04.629
I'm her mom.

411
21:04.629 --> 21:05.549
She's allergic to penicillin

412
21:05.549 --> 21:06.430
and sulfa.

413
21:06.990 --> 21:07.950
Know her blood type?

414
21:07.950 --> 21:09.069
In case of a transfusion...

415
21:09.069 --> 21:09.629
I know!

416
21:09.890 --> 21:10.750
Type AB, same as me.

417
21:10.750 --> 21:11.750
Draw mine. I can donate.

418
21:11.750 --> 21:12.869
He can't! No!

419
21:14.109 --> 21:15.190
Just a routine inquiry.

420
21:18.710 --> 21:19.549
Why can't I donate?

421
21:20.353 --> 21:21.430
Penicillin and sulfa allergies

422
21:21.430 --> 21:22.270
are both hereditary.

423
21:22.789 --> 21:23.349
The odds

424
21:23.389 --> 21:24.109
of being allergic

425
21:24.109 --> 21:24.589
to both

426
21:24.589 --> 21:25.389
is only 0.0037%.

427
21:25.789 --> 21:26.629
Same blood type

428
21:26.629 --> 21:27.190
as me,

429
21:28.470 --> 21:29.549
and her age matches

430
21:29.670 --> 21:30.750
our first night together.

431
21:31.349 --> 21:31.869
I have

432
21:31.869 --> 21:32.589
had a bold idea.

433
21:33.274 --> 21:34.450
You know what I'm thinking.

434
21:34.710 --> 21:35.549
Is it what I think?

435
21:37.829 --> 21:38.589
Is it what I think?

436
21:39.309 --> 21:39.789
Is it?

437
21:40.710 --> 21:41.309
Yes!

438
21:41.430 --> 21:42.349
It's what you think!

439
21:42.750 --> 21:43.430
Chestnut's

440
21:43.710 --> 21:44.389
"disappeared dad"

441
21:44.510 --> 21:44.950
is me?

442
21:45.950 --> 21:46.670
Adorable Chestnut

443
21:46.789 --> 21:47.430
is my daughter?

444
21:48.109 --> 21:48.869
I have a daughter!

445
21:49.444 --> 21:50.190
I have a daughter!

446
21:50.190 --> 21:50.910
Keep it down!

447
21:52.270 --> 21:53.089
I have a daughter.

448
21:55.389 --> 21:56.156
I have a daughter.

449
22:02.782 --> 22:03.829
(Peng Cheng is Di Liren's)

450
22:03.829 --> 22:04.995
(fellow townsman.)

451
22:04.995 --> 22:06.349
(Drifting through Jiangzhou,)

452
22:06.430 --> 22:07.389
(living gig to gig,)

453
22:07.470 --> 22:08.990
(yet gambling away a fortune.)

454
22:09.629 --> 22:10.710
(The origin of his funds)

455
22:11.030 --> 22:12.030
(is nowhere to be found,)

456
22:12.389 --> 22:13.869
(clearly deliberately hidden.)

457
22:14.485 --> 22:15.629
(Given Peng Cheng's network)

458
22:15.629 --> 22:16.389
(in Jiangzhou,)

459
22:16.510 --> 22:17.589
(only Di Liren)

460
22:17.829 --> 22:18.589
(could do this.)

461
22:21.143 --> 22:22.159
(Meet and talk tomorrow.)

462
22:30.160 --> 22:31.080
(Chat History, Yu Meng)

463
22:31.080 --> 22:32.264
(Delete)

464
22:58.999 --> 23:00.420
I sleep best when I'm holding you.

465
23:01.069 --> 23:02.190
These years, I often dreamed

466
23:02.230 --> 23:03.149
of moments like this.

467
23:04.789 --> 23:05.829
Half a life of hard work,

468
23:07.470 --> 23:08.950
it finally came true.

469
23:27.910 --> 23:28.470
What's wrong?

470
23:29.149 --> 23:29.750
What happened?

471
23:29.750 --> 23:30.313
Since when do you

472
23:30.313 --> 23:31.435
snore and grind your teeth?

473
23:32.389 --> 23:33.510
You sound like a chainsaw.

474
23:34.869 --> 23:35.389
I'm sorry.

475
23:36.309 --> 23:37.910
I might have drunk too much tonight.

476
23:39.149 --> 23:40.252
I'll be careful next time.

477
23:40.629 --> 23:41.990
You were never like this before.

478
23:45.030 --> 23:45.670
It might just be

479
23:45.670 --> 23:46.710
too much stress lately.

480
23:48.789 --> 23:50.470
I'll book a sleep clinic tomorrow.

481
23:51.309 --> 23:52.230
Just sleep tonight.

482
23:54.430 --> 23:55.190
Guest room,

483
23:55.910 --> 23:56.549
or stay far.

484
24:05.349 --> 24:06.470
Just because I snore?

485
24:07.750 --> 24:08.629
We finally...

486
24:08.629 --> 24:09.470
I've had neurasthenia

487
24:09.470 --> 24:10.230
for months.

488
24:10.430 --> 24:11.214
Should I remind you

489
24:11.670 --> 24:12.789
when it all started?

490
24:54.344 --> 24:57.480
(Breaking! Hongli Garment Factory Owner Lu Zhiming Died in Car Crash)

491
25:00.030 --> 25:00.750
You're right.

492
25:02.149 --> 25:03.190
I do suspect Peng Cheng

493
25:03.349 --> 25:04.750
is tied to my dad's death.

494
25:05.149 --> 25:06.470
But at my dad's crash scene,

495
25:07.629 --> 25:08.750
there were no witnesses,

496
25:09.270 --> 25:10.510
no surveillance, nothing.

497
25:10.710 --> 25:11.549
The report also said

498
25:11.670 --> 25:12.710
the rollover was caused

499
25:12.829 --> 25:13.750
by my dad's error.

500
25:14.109 --> 25:15.829
No external factors involved.

501
25:16.950 --> 25:17.629
So we held

502
25:17.670 --> 25:18.589
the funeral very soon.

503
25:20.190 --> 25:21.230
Until recently,

504
25:22.430 --> 25:23.869
I saw with my own eyes

505
25:24.306 --> 25:25.109
Peng Cheng is still

506
25:25.109 --> 25:26.176
in contact with Di Liren.

507
25:26.750 --> 25:27.230
Exactly.

508
25:28.309 --> 25:30.470
I had Jiao Xu look into Peng Cheng.

509
25:32.109 --> 25:33.109
After your dad died,

510
25:33.743 --> 25:34.876
Peng Cheng left Xiaocheng.

511
25:35.470 --> 25:35.950
That's why

512
25:35.950 --> 25:36.910
nobody ever knew

513
25:37.389 --> 25:38.750
his connection with Di Liren.

514
25:39.829 --> 25:40.309
Ms. Hui,

515
25:41.750 --> 25:43.149
if your dad's death

516
25:44.030 --> 25:45.230
really involves Di Liren,

517
25:46.829 --> 25:47.510
what will you do?

518
25:50.470 --> 25:51.510
Jiao Xu and I can help you

519
25:52.309 --> 25:53.190
review the evidence

520
25:53.664 --> 25:54.605
and push for a retrial.

521
25:54.990 --> 25:55.990
We can work together

522
25:56.389 --> 25:57.470
to put Di Liren in prison.

523
25:57.982 --> 25:59.233
Peng Cheng is the only witness.

524
26:00.190 --> 26:01.069
If he doesn't confess,

525
26:02.030 --> 26:03.470
it will just be the same as before.

526
26:05.349 --> 26:06.030
I'll help you.

527
26:07.309 --> 26:08.149
I lived with Di Liren

528
26:08.389 --> 26:09.629
for five years,

529
26:10.069 --> 26:11.750
and after what has happened recently,

530
26:11.990 --> 26:13.190
I know exactly what he'll do

531
26:13.230 --> 26:13.990
to Peng Cheng.

532
26:15.349 --> 26:15.829
True.

533
26:16.869 --> 26:17.430
Now,

534
26:17.589 --> 26:18.910
being in the same house with him,

535
26:19.950 --> 26:21.510
I just feel weird and distant.

536
26:23.069 --> 26:23.549
All right.

537
26:24.109 --> 26:26.109
Let's trace it back from the beginning.

538
26:26.589 --> 26:27.109
How did you

539
26:27.109 --> 26:28.030
meet Di Liren at first?

540
26:28.990 --> 26:30.710
My dad funded his education back then.

541
26:31.190 --> 26:31.869
After graduation,

542
26:31.869 --> 26:33.190
he joined my dad's factory.

543
26:33.529 --> 26:34.470
He said it was to repay

544
26:34.470 --> 26:35.230
my dad's kindness.

545
26:36.230 --> 26:37.030
My dad was thrilled

546
26:38.190 --> 26:39.389
and groomed him for key roles.

547
26:40.109 --> 26:41.389
So you two met

548
26:41.950 --> 26:42.910
and got together

549
26:43.309 --> 26:44.030
back then?

550
26:44.710 --> 26:45.109
No.

551
26:46.190 --> 26:47.710
I was working at a hospital back then.

552
26:48.823 --> 26:49.987
We didn't cross paths much.

553
26:50.148 --> 26:51.067
Barely knew each other.

554
26:51.272 --> 26:51.789
(Xiaocheng, 21 years ago)

555
26:51.789 --> 26:53.349
(But when my dad passed away,)

556
26:53.950 --> 26:55.309
(I was devastated)

557
26:55.470 --> 26:56.230
(and all alone.)

558
26:57.670 --> 26:58.389
(Every day,)

559
26:58.549 --> 27:00.030
(I worried creditors would show up.)

560
27:01.230 --> 27:01.950
(It was Di Liren)

561
27:02.950 --> 27:03.670
(who repeatedly)

562
27:03.710 --> 27:04.710
(stood by my side)

563
27:05.470 --> 27:06.430
(and shielded me.)

564
27:07.629 --> 27:08.829
(My dad's unfinished debts)

565
27:08.869 --> 27:09.470
(and projects)

566
27:09.470 --> 27:10.230
(must be settled.)

567
27:10.869 --> 27:11.910
(People needed answers.)

568
27:13.270 --> 27:13.829
(However,)

569
27:14.230 --> 27:14.950
(I knew nothing)

570
27:14.990 --> 27:15.829
(about our business,)

571
27:16.629 --> 27:18.109
(having no experience and no clue.)

572
27:19.109 --> 27:19.990
(Fortunately,)

573
27:19.990 --> 27:21.190
(Di Liren knew everything)

574
27:21.549 --> 27:22.430
(and took it over.)

575
27:23.990 --> 27:24.750
(He handled)

576
27:24.869 --> 27:26.789
(everything flawlessly and properly.)

577
27:27.597 --> 27:29.008
(Acquisition Agreement of Hongli) Not a single flaw could be found.

578
27:30.230 --> 27:31.270
So when he told me

579
27:31.589 --> 27:33.069
the factory was losing money,

580
27:33.670 --> 27:34.710
(Acquisition Agreement of Hongli) its finances were in terrible shape

581
27:34.869 --> 27:36.349
and he had to sell it quickly

582
27:36.349 --> 27:37.309
to pay off the debts,

583
27:38.710 --> 27:39.309
and when I saw

584
27:39.750 --> 27:40.789
the financial statements

585
27:40.910 --> 27:41.670
(Balance Sheet, Financial Statements) showing profits declining every year,

586
27:42.309 --> 27:44.190
I remembered my dad often saying

587
27:44.670 --> 27:45.670
business was tough

588
27:46.069 --> 27:47.190
and profits were poor,

589
27:48.149 --> 27:48.950
so I agreed.

590
27:51.710 --> 27:52.510
Thinking back now,

591
27:52.549 --> 27:54.030
I was so foolish back then.

592
27:54.629 --> 27:55.829
Although it wasn't doing well,

593
27:56.829 --> 27:57.829
it was nowhere near

594
27:58.309 --> 27:59.510
having to file for bankruptcy.

595
28:00.829 --> 28:01.750
Where is the money?

596
28:02.549 --> 28:03.109
Anything left?

597
28:03.349 --> 28:04.430
He said it all went

598
28:05.309 --> 28:06.270
to debts and payroll.

599
28:08.190 --> 28:08.629
Ms. Hui,

600
28:09.829 --> 28:10.710
don't you think

601
28:11.470 --> 28:12.990
he was preying on your family?

602
28:13.510 --> 28:14.069
Look.

603
28:14.710 --> 28:15.589
After your dad died,

604
28:15.910 --> 28:17.349
he moved in on you,

605
28:17.829 --> 28:18.589
exploited your lack

606
28:18.589 --> 28:19.230
of experience,

607
28:19.510 --> 28:20.510
and sold your factory.

608
28:21.270 --> 28:22.389
So I reasonably suspect

609
28:22.549 --> 28:23.270
that before me,

610
28:23.750 --> 28:24.950
the first family he preyed on

611
28:25.190 --> 28:25.990
was yours.

612
28:26.349 --> 28:27.789
I thought he was saving me.

613
28:28.869 --> 28:30.510
Turns out he was dragging me down.

614
28:32.589 --> 28:34.109
Instead of saving me,

615
28:35.230 --> 28:36.549
he cast me into an abyss.

616
28:37.910 --> 28:39.149
If Di Liren is truly guilty,

617
28:40.510 --> 28:41.789
I will make sure

618
28:41.990 --> 28:42.750
he pays the price.

619
28:45.309 --> 28:45.750
By the way,

620
28:46.750 --> 28:47.549
I just had an idea

621
28:48.389 --> 28:49.349
about Peng Cheng.

622
28:50.589 --> 28:51.470
I'll look into it.

623
28:52.990 --> 28:54.629
Contact me anytime if anything comes up.

624
28:56.109 --> 28:56.710
Call Jiao Xu

625
28:57.109 --> 28:57.869
or Liu Zi.

626
28:58.270 --> 28:58.869
What is this?

627
28:59.869 --> 29:00.470
Concern?

628
29:02.109 --> 29:03.910
Call it whatever you want.

629
29:04.629 --> 29:05.750
I never imagined

630
29:06.309 --> 29:07.069
our relationship

631
29:07.190 --> 29:08.309
would end up like this.

632
29:10.309 --> 29:11.109
Neither did I.

633
29:12.869 --> 29:13.869
Fate dealt us

634
29:14.069 --> 29:15.030
the exact same hand.

635
29:15.230 --> 29:16.695
We were preyed upon by the same man.

636
29:16.990 --> 29:17.829
You could call it

637
29:18.069 --> 29:19.030
a strange kind of fate.

638
29:19.349 --> 29:20.829
I just hope there won't be

639
29:20.829 --> 29:22.030
a next victim.

640
29:26.990 --> 29:27.549
Stay safe.

641
29:34.910 --> 29:36.309
I've told you many times.

642
29:37.030 --> 29:37.670
I really...

643
29:39.109 --> 29:39.829
See for yourself!

644
29:40.910 --> 29:41.869
My pockets are empty!

645
29:41.869 --> 29:42.349
Oh, right.

646
29:43.510 --> 29:44.030
Look.

647
29:44.030 --> 29:45.030
Search my pockets.

648
29:45.230 --> 29:46.430
Come on. Check them yourself.

649
29:49.030 --> 29:49.869
Let me tell you.

650
29:51.109 --> 29:52.829
If that money isn't in my account soon,

651
29:53.950 --> 29:55.149
I'll go straight to Lu Hui.

652
29:56.389 --> 29:56.990
Think about it.

653
29:58.470 --> 29:59.309
The money is ready.

654
30:00.990 --> 30:01.518
Just say it?

655
30:02.950 --> 30:04.051
Zhang Tao will transfer it.

656
30:04.349 --> 30:05.230
That's more like it!

657
30:05.309 --> 30:06.549
That's what friends are for,

658
30:06.589 --> 30:07.030
right?

659
30:08.750 --> 30:09.190
But...

660
30:09.389 --> 30:10.030
You.

661
30:10.230 --> 30:11.670
You've fooled me

662
30:11.750 --> 30:12.670
so many times before.

663
30:12.789 --> 30:13.629
You have to give me

664
30:13.670 --> 30:14.750
an exact transfer time.

665
30:18.190 --> 30:18.910
3 PM,

666
30:19.629 --> 30:20.109
Wednesday.

667
30:20.589 --> 30:21.510
If it's a minute late,

668
30:22.389 --> 30:24.069
I'll tell Lu Hui everything

669
30:24.470 --> 30:25.270
from that day.

670
30:27.549 --> 30:28.190
Don't worry.

671
30:28.950 --> 30:29.710
It will be there.

672
30:34.430 --> 30:35.629
Look at you now.

673
30:36.030 --> 30:36.829
After the divorce,

674
30:36.829 --> 30:38.069
you don't even dress properly.

675
30:38.470 --> 30:39.030
Go away!

676
30:39.869 --> 30:40.349
What?

677
30:40.629 --> 30:41.750
I helped you with it before!

678
30:41.829 --> 30:42.270
Get lost!

679
30:43.798 --> 30:45.109
Trying to scare me?

680
30:47.589 --> 30:48.589
Seriously,

681
30:49.789 --> 30:51.030
always hoarding the good stuff.

682
30:51.589 --> 30:52.270
Let me tell you.

683
30:52.750 --> 30:53.670
If it's a minute late,

684
30:54.549 --> 30:55.230
I'll find Lu Hui.

685
30:56.910 --> 30:57.389
Got it?

686
30:58.629 --> 30:59.510
Don't forget!

687
31:09.117 --> 31:09.672
One Bamboo.

688
31:10.510 --> 31:10.869
I win!

689
31:13.869 --> 31:14.470
I'm done.

690
31:14.629 --> 31:16.149
My hand's absolute garbage.

691
31:16.710 --> 31:17.750
You've smelled garbage?

692
31:19.470 --> 31:20.389
Here, take it all.

693
31:20.589 --> 31:21.190
No more.

694
31:21.629 --> 31:21.990
Okay.

695
31:21.990 --> 31:22.470
I'm done.

696
31:24.346 --> 31:24.950
Let's call it.

697
31:24.950 --> 31:26.024
Might as well get a drink.

698
31:42.270 --> 31:42.629
You...

699
31:43.109 --> 31:43.549
Why...

700
31:44.030 --> 31:45.670
Why are you looking for me again?

701
31:46.629 --> 31:48.230
I want to know what happened

702
31:49.349 --> 31:50.549
the day my dad died.

703
31:51.030 --> 31:51.750
Who's your dad?

704
31:52.510 --> 31:53.716
I don't even know who you are,

705
31:53.716 --> 31:54.430
and you're asking me about your dad?

706
31:54.430 --> 31:55.149
Are you for real?

707
31:55.589 --> 31:56.629
My dad was Lu Zhiming.

708
31:57.389 --> 31:58.309
I know you know me,

709
31:59.589 --> 32:00.389
and you've been

710
32:00.389 --> 32:01.549
asking Di Liren for money.

711
32:03.710 --> 32:04.230
So, let's

712
32:04.230 --> 32:05.670
lay all our cards on the table.

713
32:06.670 --> 32:07.910
As long as you tell me

714
32:08.629 --> 32:09.430
what really happened

715
32:10.230 --> 32:10.910
the day

716
32:10.910 --> 32:11.990
my dad had the accident,

717
32:13.109 --> 32:14.270
whatever Di Liren

718
32:14.309 --> 32:15.109
promised you,

719
32:16.990 --> 32:18.470
I will

720
32:20.470 --> 32:21.270
top it.

721
32:42.750 --> 32:43.510
Sorry,

722
32:44.670 --> 32:45.270
I don't know

723
32:45.349 --> 32:46.170
what you're saying.

724
32:46.710 --> 32:47.789
As for asking for money,

725
32:47.869 --> 32:49.349
you might have got the wrong idea.

726
32:50.270 --> 32:50.990
Who am I?

727
32:51.589 --> 32:52.149
I'm just...

728
32:55.309 --> 32:56.629
Mr. Di is a big boss.

729
32:56.710 --> 32:57.670
How would I dare?

730
32:58.190 --> 32:59.109
I was just

731
32:59.149 --> 32:59.869
borrowing money

732
32:59.950 --> 33:00.950
as an old friend.

733
33:08.510 --> 33:09.629
Don't come again.

734
33:10.069 --> 33:10.910
Ask all you want.

735
33:11.230 --> 33:12.030
I'm not budging.

736
33:13.629 --> 33:14.109
I'm leaving.

737
33:23.688 --> 33:29.640
(Mahjong Parlor)

738
33:35.430 --> 33:36.190
Who are you?

739
33:36.549 --> 33:36.910
Get in!

740
33:37.270 --> 33:38.389
Easy. Easy!

741
33:38.629 --> 33:39.069
Easy!

742
33:39.629 --> 33:41.030
What do you want?

743
33:43.510 --> 33:43.990
Don't move.

744
33:44.789 --> 33:45.349
Di Liren...

745
33:46.910 --> 33:48.230
Why did Mr. Di send you here?

746
33:50.670 --> 33:51.750
I sent him here.

747
34:01.549 --> 34:02.230
You...

748
34:04.309 --> 34:05.109
What are you doing

749
34:05.109 --> 34:06.109
in the dark?

750
34:06.629 --> 34:07.869
I have told you many times.

751
34:08.229 --> 34:09.229
I don't know anything!

752
34:09.269 --> 34:10.189
Di Liren and I

753
34:10.390 --> 34:11.390
aren't even that close.

754
34:11.669 --> 34:12.549
Why won't you

755
34:12.549 --> 34:13.350
just listen?

756
34:14.069 --> 34:14.870
I'm telling you.

757
34:15.189 --> 34:15.950
If you keep it up,

758
34:15.950 --> 34:16.749
I'll call the cops!

759
34:17.589 --> 34:19.109
Relax, we're just talking.

760
34:19.510 --> 34:20.269
If you're worried,

761
34:20.269 --> 34:21.189
I can drive us right up

762
34:21.229 --> 34:21.830
to the police.

763
34:22.030 --> 34:23.629
Yeah, don't be so nervous.

764
34:24.149 --> 34:25.189
We just have a recording

765
34:25.310 --> 34:26.350
about you.

766
34:26.549 --> 34:27.430
We want you to listen.

767
34:28.109 --> 34:28.910
What recording?

768
34:29.443 --> 34:30.589
A recording of me singing,

769
34:30.589 --> 34:31.749
or cussing someone out?

770
34:36.936 --> 34:38.749
(Recording)

771
34:38.749 --> 34:39.430
(Every time)

772
34:39.430 --> 34:40.558
(you wire Peng Cheng money,)

773
34:40.749 --> 34:41.589
(you must record it.)

774
34:42.310 --> 34:43.669
(Watch what you say to him, too.)

775
34:43.830 --> 34:45.229
(Subtly steer the conversation)

776
34:45.269 --> 34:46.310
(toward extortion.)

777
34:50.470 --> 34:50.990
Well?

778
34:51.589 --> 34:52.269
Di Liren's voice

779
34:52.310 --> 34:53.229
sounds familiar, huh?

780
34:53.549 --> 34:55.069
Every time you asked him for money,

781
34:55.189 --> 34:56.030
he recorded it.

782
34:56.430 --> 34:57.149
Because he'll use

783
34:57.189 --> 34:58.549
extortion charges

784
34:59.149 --> 35:00.229
to put you behind bars.

785
35:01.990 --> 35:03.510
Didn't he promise you

786
35:03.950 --> 35:05.069
he'd transfer the money

787
35:05.310 --> 35:06.350
by 3 PM this Wednesday?

788
35:07.950 --> 35:08.589
He really

789
35:08.749 --> 35:10.310
is having Zhang Tao send you the money.

790
35:10.669 --> 35:12.629
But the second you take it,

791
35:13.830 --> 35:14.709
your prison sentence

792
35:15.229 --> 35:16.390
will be sealed.

793
35:19.669 --> 35:20.589
That shameless fool!

794
35:23.430 --> 35:24.430
Tomorrow is Wednesday.

795
35:24.890 --> 35:26.269
The money hasn't been transferred,

796
35:26.830 --> 35:27.390
which means

797
35:28.310 --> 35:29.350
you still have a chance.

798
35:30.310 --> 35:30.907
Meaning what?

799
35:32.990 --> 35:34.229
Zhang Tao might not send it,

800
35:34.910 --> 35:35.990
provided that

801
35:35.990 --> 35:37.310
you explain every detail

802
35:37.310 --> 35:38.510
of my dad's car crash.

803
35:39.310 --> 35:40.030
Come clean,

804
35:40.549 --> 35:41.709
and my previous offer

805
35:41.749 --> 35:42.510
still stands.

806
35:43.510 --> 35:44.189
Keep quiet,

807
35:44.709 --> 35:46.189
and the amount Di Liren sends

808
35:46.749 --> 35:47.950
is enough to keep you

809
35:48.189 --> 35:49.030
behind bars

810
35:49.069 --> 35:49.910
forever.

811
35:50.350 --> 35:51.310
The outside world,

812
35:51.830 --> 35:52.589
mahjong parlors,

813
35:52.990 --> 35:53.790
and nightlife,

814
35:55.149 --> 35:56.470
will have nothing to do with you.

815
35:58.629 --> 35:59.830
No time for you to think.

816
36:00.950 --> 36:01.950
Large wire transfers

817
36:01.990 --> 36:03.030
need advance scheduling.

818
36:03.669 --> 36:04.870
Zhang Tao is handling it soon.

819
36:05.235 --> 36:05.790
I'll give you

820
36:05.790 --> 36:07.030
one last three-count.

821
36:07.990 --> 36:08.430
Three,

822
36:10.950 --> 36:11.430
two...

823
36:15.950 --> 36:16.430
I'll talk!

824
36:20.262 --> 36:21.430
When your dad had his crash,

825
36:22.790 --> 36:24.549
Di Liren approached me

826
36:24.549 --> 36:25.350
first.

827
36:28.109 --> 36:28.910
He came to me.

828
36:29.709 --> 36:30.470
Our company

829
36:30.470 --> 36:31.350
was drowning in debt.

830
36:32.390 --> 36:34.109
We only wanted

831
36:34.269 --> 36:35.069
to corner him

832
36:35.109 --> 36:36.310
and get him to sign an IOU.

833
36:36.390 --> 36:37.990
We never expected it to blow up.

834
36:52.629 --> 36:54.269
Didn't I say I'd send you the money?

835
36:56.430 --> 36:56.870
Yeah,

836
36:57.229 --> 36:59.189
and once I take your cash,

837
36:59.870 --> 37:01.189
you'll call the cops

838
37:01.669 --> 37:02.790
and report me for extortion.

839
37:04.830 --> 37:05.910
How could I do that?

840
37:06.629 --> 37:07.149
I wouldn't.

841
37:11.350 --> 37:11.870
Did someone

842
37:11.950 --> 37:12.669
tip you off?

843
37:13.030 --> 37:14.350
Does anyone need to tip me off?

844
37:14.870 --> 37:16.189
We've been friends for decades.

845
37:16.189 --> 37:17.109
You think I don't know

846
37:17.149 --> 37:18.229
the tricks you're pulling?

847
37:19.830 --> 37:20.629
What's that saying?

848
37:20.629 --> 37:21.870
Take a shower with a raincoat.

849
37:21.870 --> 37:22.510
Now, you're just

850
37:22.510 --> 37:23.629
moonwalking naked

851
37:23.709 --> 37:24.749
in broad daylight.

852
37:26.390 --> 37:27.589
Isn't that the truth?

853
37:27.988 --> 37:29.430
Believe it or not, it's up to you.

854
37:29.709 --> 37:30.350
Get lost.

855
37:32.549 --> 37:33.269
If you think

856
37:33.390 --> 37:34.669
I'll trap you with a transfer,

857
37:35.350 --> 37:36.390
do you still want it?

858
37:36.549 --> 37:37.269
Of course,

859
37:39.229 --> 37:39.629
I want it.

860
37:41.390 --> 37:41.910
Triple.

861
37:43.830 --> 37:44.430
Triple?

862
37:45.069 --> 37:45.629
Triple.

863
37:48.549 --> 37:49.229
Based on what?

864
37:50.189 --> 37:51.069
You're pulling

865
37:51.189 --> 37:51.870
a fake extortion

866
37:52.174 --> 37:53.109
to jack up the price.

867
37:59.749 --> 38:00.350
Based on this.

868
38:03.816 --> 38:04.712
(IOU: Received 100,000 yuan from Lu Zhiming)

869
38:04.712 --> 38:05.544
(Term: 7 days, due on October 5, 2004)

870
38:05.544 --> 38:06.344
(Borrower assumes full legal liability if payment is overdue)

871
38:06.344 --> 38:07.222
(Borrower: Fang Yong)

872
38:13.910 --> 38:14.629
Be careful.

873
38:25.669 --> 38:26.629
How do you have this?

874
38:27.310 --> 38:27.910
I already...

875
38:27.950 --> 38:28.390
Burned it,

876
38:28.990 --> 38:29.350
right?

877
38:30.709 --> 38:32.229
The one burned back then was fake.

878
38:33.189 --> 38:34.549
I swapped it out long ago.

879
38:34.790 --> 38:36.030
You think all my years

880
38:36.149 --> 38:36.749
in casinos

881
38:36.790 --> 38:37.749
were for nothing?

882
38:38.149 --> 38:39.430
I pulled a switcheroo

883
38:39.669 --> 38:40.390
on that thing.

884
38:40.549 --> 38:41.790
The real one was long gone.

885
38:41.870 --> 38:43.109
You never even noticed.

886
38:49.470 --> 38:50.870
You keep calling me your friend,

887
38:51.709 --> 38:53.030
but never treated me like one.

888
38:53.189 --> 38:54.390
Let's not point fingers.

889
38:54.950 --> 38:55.669
We're even.

890
38:57.629 --> 38:59.030
If I hadn't covered my own back,

891
38:59.269 --> 39:00.069
I'd be sitting

892
39:00.149 --> 39:00.950
in a cell now.

893
39:09.109 --> 39:10.709
Having this won't help you anyway.

894
39:12.669 --> 39:13.589
What does it prove?

895
39:15.669 --> 39:16.709
Listen up, then.

896
39:17.350 --> 39:18.749
At the very least, it proves

897
39:19.629 --> 39:20.950
that you and Lu Zhiming

898
39:21.430 --> 39:22.350
had financial disputes.

899
39:22.870 --> 39:23.629
I can also prove

900
39:23.790 --> 39:24.749
that you're tied

901
39:24.910 --> 39:25.749
to that car crash.

902
39:26.350 --> 39:27.229
Don't you dare forget

903
39:27.669 --> 39:28.310
that everything

904
39:28.470 --> 39:29.470
started because of you.

905
39:29.629 --> 39:31.269
You were the root cause

906
39:31.669 --> 39:32.390
and the trigger.

907
39:32.950 --> 39:33.830
Not a threat,

908
39:34.430 --> 39:35.269
but if this case

909
39:35.350 --> 39:36.510
ever gets reopened,

910
39:36.669 --> 39:39.069
I'm pinning the whole thing on you

911
39:39.709 --> 39:40.430
as the mastermind.

912
39:42.749 --> 39:44.069
I don't know what you're saying.

913
39:44.189 --> 39:44.749
Yeah, right.

914
39:44.749 --> 39:45.669
Play dumb all you want.

915
39:46.269 --> 39:47.030
No problem.

916
39:47.589 --> 39:48.950
I'm just laying out

917
39:48.990 --> 39:49.669
the pros and cons

918
39:49.669 --> 39:50.910
of this whole thing for you,

919
39:51.430 --> 39:52.109
to see if the gig

920
39:52.149 --> 39:52.790
is worth it.

921
39:53.470 --> 39:54.790
If you don't want it,

922
39:54.790 --> 39:55.950
I'll just go to Lu Hui.

923
39:57.030 --> 39:57.790
When that happens,

924
39:57.790 --> 39:58.629
I'll dump everything

925
39:58.629 --> 39:59.510
right on you.

926
39:59.830 --> 40:01.510
I'll take the money and disappear,

927
40:02.310 --> 40:03.149
but you

928
40:04.149 --> 40:05.149
will have nowhere to run.

929
40:07.069 --> 40:07.749
A bit sudden,

930
40:08.310 --> 40:08.830
isn't it?

931
40:09.390 --> 40:10.390
I suggest you reconsider.

932
40:10.709 --> 40:11.149
Reconsider.

933
40:18.069 --> 40:19.269
The same card as before?

934
40:19.990 --> 40:20.510
Cash.

935
40:24.749 --> 40:26.030
This time, I want cash.

936
40:33.749 --> 40:34.950
(He agreed to pay triple)

937
40:34.950 --> 40:35.543
(for the IOU.)

938
40:35.990 --> 40:37.030
(Once he gets it ready,)

939
40:37.350 --> 40:38.069
(he'll text me)

940
40:38.189 --> 40:39.229
(the time and location.)

941
40:39.476 --> 40:40.189
(I'll forward it)

942
40:40.189 --> 40:40.910
(right away.)

943
40:44.310 --> 40:45.629
Maybe I'm just being paranoid,

944
40:46.669 --> 40:48.310
but if Peng Cheng could betray Di Liren,

945
40:48.870 --> 40:49.870
could Di Liren

946
40:50.030 --> 40:50.790
talk him back over

947
40:51.149 --> 40:51.749
and have him

948
40:52.269 --> 40:53.069
turn on us again?

949
40:54.470 --> 40:54.990
No.

950
40:55.709 --> 40:56.549
Since he brought up

951
40:56.589 --> 40:57.430
the IOU,

952
40:57.629 --> 40:58.870
it means he's determined

953
40:58.870 --> 41:00.149
to sever ties with Di Liren.

954
41:02.589 --> 41:03.629
Right now,

955
41:04.030 --> 41:05.430
we have the IOU as proof,

956
41:06.109 --> 41:07.510
but Di Liren is too shrewd.

957
41:07.830 --> 41:09.350
To avoid leaving evidence on tape,

958
41:09.910 --> 41:10.870
once he hears anything

959
41:11.430 --> 41:13.390
about my dad's crash,

960
41:14.229 --> 41:15.390
he denies all involvement

961
41:16.149 --> 41:17.669
and distances himself completely.

962
41:20.629 --> 41:21.910
So we must use

963
41:21.990 --> 41:22.749
this IOU

964
41:23.149 --> 41:23.990
to draw Di Liren out,

965
41:24.390 --> 41:25.870
catch him red-handed,

966
41:26.430 --> 41:27.589
and prove his guilt.

967
41:29.749 --> 41:30.589
Guilt is a disease.

968
41:31.870 --> 41:33.109
I'll make sure he gets cured.

969
41:39.950 --> 41:40.470
For you.

970
41:41.510 --> 41:42.229
I remember this is

971
41:42.229 --> 41:43.149
your usual perfume.

972
41:45.069 --> 41:46.109
Wearing perfume as a maid

973
41:46.269 --> 41:47.629
often gets complaints.

974
41:48.350 --> 41:49.341
Quit using it ages ago.

975
41:50.078 --> 41:50.944
Don't even like it.

976
41:52.069 --> 41:53.549
Now I'm more used to the smell

977
41:53.549 --> 41:54.830
of disinfectant and hand soap.

978
41:55.990 --> 41:56.982
You love staying clean.

979
41:57.310 --> 41:58.149
Always been fresh.

980
41:58.910 --> 41:59.470
You don't need

981
41:59.470 --> 42:00.510
these fancy scents anyway.

982
42:00.990 --> 42:01.549
Just use it

983
42:02.189 --> 42:03.350
as an air freshener.

984
42:05.709 --> 42:06.229
Honey,

985
42:08.069 --> 42:08.510
the company

986
42:08.510 --> 42:09.549
just landed a big project,

987
42:10.310 --> 42:11.790
so cash flow is a bit tight.

988
42:12.669 --> 42:13.669
I'll have to funnel

989
42:13.790 --> 42:14.430
all my income

990
42:14.430 --> 42:15.514
into the company for now.

991
42:17.830 --> 42:18.790
What kind of project?

992
42:19.990 --> 42:20.669
Well...

993
42:25.288 --> 42:26.888
(Beloved Father, Lu Zhiming Beloved Mother, Wang Xiuzhi)

994
42:34.600 --> 42:37.224
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

995
42:37.669 --> 42:38.189
Oh, no.

996
42:38.870 --> 42:40.189
Di Liren beat us to it again.

997
42:40.310 --> 42:41.229
Did Peng Cheng

998
42:41.470 --> 42:42.430
really turn on us again?

999
42:42.950 --> 42:44.269
He always said

1000
42:44.589 --> 42:45.589
his pockets are empty.

1001
42:45.990 --> 42:47.192
How did he suddenly get rich?

1002
42:47.669 --> 42:48.510
Are you crazy?

1003
42:49.149 --> 42:49.870
Are you crazy?

1004
42:50.109 --> 42:50.950
What are you doing?

1005
42:51.510 --> 42:52.510
I told Lu Hui

1006
42:52.870 --> 42:54.030
that her dad's death

1007
42:54.069 --> 42:54.870
was on you.

1008
42:54.910 --> 42:55.990
I'll always be here,

1009
42:56.109 --> 42:57.149
watching you,

1010
42:57.390 --> 42:58.069
staying close.

1011
42:58.318 --> 42:59.470
You'll never get rid of me.

1012
42:59.470 --> 43:01.030
Your current wife, Lu Hui,

1013
43:01.269 --> 43:02.709
and your ex-wife, Yu Meng,

1014
43:02.950 --> 43:04.310
(Ping An Million Accident Insurance) are teaming up against you.

1015
43:04.328 --> 43:06.526
(1. Policyholder Information, Policyholder Name: Lu Hui)

1016
43:22.120 --> 43:26.989
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1017
43:29.473 --> 43:34.336
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1018
43:36.794 --> 43:41.639
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1019
43:42.084 --> 43:48.586
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1020
43:51.318 --> 43:58.271
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1021
43:58.821 --> 44:04.751
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

1022
44:05.875 --> 44:13.106
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1023
44:13.409 --> 44:18.582
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

1024
44:19.202 --> 44:30.670
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

1025
44:33.170 --> 44:38.418
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1026
44:40.459 --> 44:45.894
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

1027
44:47.716 --> 44:53.113
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1028
44:53.113 --> 45:01.758
